DESCRIPTION >
    Returns the list of distinct benchmark questions with their descriptions.

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    %
    SELECT DISTINCT
        name,
        question
    FROM benchmark_results FINAL
    WHERE model = 'human' AND provider = 'human'
    AND (validated = 1 OR {{ UInt8(include_unvalidated, 0) }} = 1)
    ORDER BY name

TYPE endpoint
